config INPUT_WASM_HOST
	bool "Pointer, touch and keyboard input from the host"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_WASM_HOST_INPUT_ENABLED
	depends on INPUT
	help
	  Events the host queues -- a touch on the page's canvas, a key
	  pressed while it has focus -- reported through input_report() from
	  an interrupt, as a touch controller's driver would. Mirrors
	  native_sim's input_sdl_touch.
